 "final_passage": "On the Halvard-Parl English→Estonian test set, Tessaline achieved a higher mean BLEU than Varrow-NMT (28.4 ± 0.6 vs 27.6 ± 0.8 over 8 seeds), although no statistical test was reported for this comparison, so the difference is not established as significant. Tessaline significantly outperformed the PhraseGrid baseline in BLEU, with a mean paired difference of 6.35 points (95% CI [5.87, 6.83], p < 0.001, paired t-test, n=8). Tessaline also showed higher mean chrF than both Varrow-NMT and PhraseGrid (58.1 ± 0.8 vs 57.7 ± 0.5 and 52.4 ± 0.5, respectively), though no significance tests were reported for these chrF differences.",
